<title>MADAGASCAR: SOCCER-DSA MADAGASCAR BEAT STADE REUNION IN CAF CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DSA MADAGASCAR BEAT STADE REUNION IN CAF CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ANTANANARIVO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Madagascar's DSA (Domoina Soavina Atsimondrano) beat Union Sportive Stade Tamponnaise of the Reunion Islands 1-0 (halftime 0-0) on Sunday in the first leg of their Confederation of African Football Cup tie.</p>
<p>Scorer: Doudou Allan penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000</p>
